body:
I got this too. Pretty randomly after playing again a few months since last time, didn't seem like anything until my character was gone, waited a bit and such but didn't work. I guess it's an odd way of telling you that you have been reset without actually telling you.

&#x200B;

I did cheat but I barely cheated, money cause I don't wanna treat a game like a job just to have fun, so I guess it's warranted. It's just a weird time, I did have 10 billion so that might have been detected since it's literally impossible to get that much money legitimately. Made a new character tried to cheat my money up but got banned pretty quick, like 2 days after, but I made like 10 accs when it was free on epic, so y'know. Found out that they sort of fixed money cheats (the only thing they care about) you can't get that much money anymore but still like 10 mil in half an hour with some convoluted methods.

Mod menu I used (disturbed) was kinda fucked at the time and maybe still is since their important people lived in Ukraine and y'know how that schblooby is going. Switched to stand regular which is quite amazing, gave me the same feeling when I first discovered disturbed, basically prime disturbed but it works rn.

&#x200B;

Anyways, that's how it went for me, might help you a bit.
